        "date": "2026-05-15T23:12:33Z",
        "email": "nelson@romaine.life",
        "name": "Nelson Romaine"
      },
      "message": "Fix lint: rename workflow .yml→.yaml, add trailing newlines\n\nWorkflow files renamed to .yaml to satisfy the pipeline-templates\nYAML Extensions lint check (which standardizes on .yaml since Helm\nrequires Chart.yaml/values.yaml exactly and the k8s ecosystem emits\n.yaml by default).\n\nTrailing newlines added to flagged files (.github/dependabot.yml,\nREADME.md, and any other tracked text files) per the Trailing\nNewlines check.\n\nStill failing after this:\n- YAML Extensions on .github/dependabot.yml — GitHub's docs only\n  officially mention dependabot.yml. Safer to fix in the lint template\n  itself (exclude .github/dependabot.{yml,yaml}) than risk renaming\n  here.\n- Filename Underscores on Python files (plant-agent) and asset paths\n  (kill-me) — these have legitimate underscores. Should be excluded\n  in the lint template.\n\nFollowup PR going up against pipeline-templates to widen those\nexclusion lists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
